[h1]Auto Day[/h1]
[b]Start Whiskerwood's next day automatically.[/b]

Auto Day confirms the game's regular end-of-day prompt for you. It is enabled by default and uses one switch in the game's native mod settings.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Automatic day confirmation:[/b] uses the game's normal NextDay action.
[*][b]One native setting:[/b] on by default; turn it off whenever you prefer manual confirmation.
[*][b]Waits when needed:[/b] waits while a window is open, the HUD is not ready, or the game reports saving or pending victory.
[*][b]English and German:[/b] other game languages use English.
[/list]

[h2]Getting started[/h2]
Subscribe and restart after Steam downloads the mod. Use either Workshop or a local installation, never both. Auto Day starts enabled; its switch is in the game's mod settings.

[h2]Preview information[/h2]
[b]v0.1.0-preview for Windows. In-game validation is pending.[/b]

Normal manual pauses during the day are unaffected. At the end-of-day stop, NextDay may also clear a manual pause that happened at the same time, just as pressing the game's button would.

Auto Day checks about once per second and makes one request per calendar day and loaded session. There are no automatic retries; the game's manual confirmation remains available.

